It is early morning.
I sit in my new kitchen and drink tea.
It is half past seven.
I look at my new calendar.
It hangs on the wall.
Right now it is January.
But soon it is February.
Today is Monday.
I often plan my week on Monday mornings.
It gives me a good start to the week.
Today I have a meeting with my team at nine o'clock.
I take a sip of my warm tea.
